Implement a PostgreSQL recursive CTE to traverse an organizational hierarchy tree with depth tracking:
- Schema: TABLE employees (id SERIAL PRIMARY KEY, name VARCHAR(50), manager_id INTEGER REFERENCES employees(id));
- Recursive CTE: WITH RECURSIVE org_hierarchy AS (SELECT id, name, manager_id, 0 AS depth FROM employees UNION ALL SELECT e.id, e.name, e.manager_id, h.depth + 1 FROM employees e JOIN org_hierarchy h ON e.manager_id = h.id) SELECT * FROM org_hierarchy;

